# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# Exception: the DEBUG keystore is intentionally committed so that local and
# CI builds share one certificate, keeping the SHA-1 registered with Firebase
# stable (required for Google Sign-In). Debug keys are not secret.
# Release keystores must still never be committed.
!app/debug.keystore
